cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these derived results, please cite the manuscript and this archive."
title: "Reduced GLP2R expression in colorectal cancer: a confounder-adjusted multi-cohort analysis — reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code (R), numeric result ledger, data manifest and manuscript tables
  for a confounder-adjusted multi-cohort analysis of GLP2R expression in
  colorectal cancer, covering tumour-vs-normal expression, survival, the immune
  microenvironment, transcriptional programmes, DNA methylation, copy number,
  somatic mutation and an eight-gene LASSO-Cox signature, in TCGA-COADREAD and
  GEO cohorts GSE39582 and GSE17536, plus pre-submission sensitivity analyses
  (tissue-source-site, C-index comparators, Hartung-Knapp, MSI-stratified
  heterogeneity, leave-GLP2R-out eigengene, MLH1 promoter-restricted control).
  The data cache, R library and intermediate .rds objects are not included;
  see README.md.
type: software
